{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured node1’s staged projects directory as the authenticated SMB share `projects`. Node2 can list, read, create, and update files as `designer`; guest and sibling access are rejected. Both nodes retained RHEL 10 and kernel 6.12.0-55.9.1.el10_0, passed sequential reboot persistence checks, and contain no test residue.","actions_performed":["Installed distribution-supported Samba 4.23.5 packages.","Created the locked designer identity from access.txt without exposing credentials.","Applied design-team permissions and persistent SELinux labeling only to the projects subtree.","Enabled a projects-only SMB configuration and source-restricted firewall access from node2.","Verified authenticated list/read/write/update behavior and negative guest/sibling access.","Safely rebooted node1 and node2 sequentially and verified changed boot identities and recovery.","Preserved the original drawings, protected sibling data, and a secure rollback copy of the prior Samba configuration."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Projects share configured securely on node1","command_ids":["cmd-026dd8fa942c4a44","cmd-c11a4c362472491b"],"summary":"Validated projects-only configuration, authenticated design-group access, active/enabled Samba, persistent SELinux labels, TCP 445 listener, and node2-scoped firewall policy."},{"requirement":"Node2 can list, read, and update as designer","command_ids":["cmd-d4f46b1c3e4547f1","cmd-f6716114413b460b","cmd-6b7a11035d3b41aa"],"summary":"Node2 listed the share and original documents, read the expected drawing hash, and completed byte-identical create/overwrite/read-back tests before and after reboots."},{"requirement":"Guest and sibling-directory access rejected","command_ids":["cmd-9389b5a64c3f4935","cmd-6b7a11035d3b41aa"],"summary":"Guest access returned ACCESS_DENIED, the private sibling returned BAD_NETWORK_NAME, and traversal outside the share failed."},{"requirement":"Initial drawings remain intact","command_ids":["cmd-4441943cd9db4b3d","cmd-c11a4c362472491b"],"summary":"Final hashes exactly match the pre-change hashes for drawing.txt and materials.csv; the protected sibling remains root-owned and mode 600."},{"requirement":"OS release and kernel preserved","command_ids":["cmd-33f36103d36147c8","cmd-301971b340c34330","cmd-c11a4c362472491b","cmd-7318eb0da8534412"],"summary":"Both nodes remained on RHEL 10.0 with kernel 6.12.0-55.9.1.el10_0."},{"requirement":"Node1 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-63119c27a8be42e2","cmd-e7cb0a4525a04414","cmd-366acb226e8c4783","cmd-be12ab470c824961"],"summary":"Healthy baseline captured; reboot acknowledged; boot ID changed from 19062a82… to 913d55fe…; service, configuration, policy, data hashes, authenticated access, and guest rejection recovered."},{"requirement":"Node2 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-f5676385a0e84259","cmd-0a1ad357bf37481d","cmd-09e7a45de85a4916","cmd-6b7a11035d3b41aa"],"summary":"Healthy client baseline captured; reboot acknowledged; boot ID changed from 6ab6a71b… to 7b2a13fe…; authenticated list/read/update access recovered."},{"requirement":"Cleanup and final condition","command_ids":["cmd-f93bfdbb0ee44221","cmd-c11a4c362472491b","cmd-7318eb0da8534412"],"summary":"Remote verification files and temporary credential/test files are absent; only the intended initial project documents remain."}]}
